Short:        Claude Code client for UP-Term
Author:       spotUP
Uploader:     UPLOADER-ADDRESS-PLACEHOLDER (spotUP)
Type:         comm/misc
Version:      @VERSION@
Replaces:     none
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0; m68k-020
Requires:     comm/term/UP-Term.lha >= @NEEDSBASE@, TCP/IP stack (Roadshow, Miami, AmiTCP), util/libs/AmiSSL-v5-OS3.lha for https
Distribution: Aminet

C:Claude and C:ClaudeCode: a Claude Code client for an UP-Term window. It reads, searches
and edits files and runs commands with your own Anthropic API key (billed to that key).
Without an UP-Term window it falls back to a line mode.

Needs the base archive UP-Term.lha (version @NEEDSBASE@ or newer) installed first.

Install: unpack, double-click Install. Uninstall removes C:Claude and C:ClaudeCode and keeps
your settings in ENVARC:Claude.

Licence: MIT (UP-Term's own code).
